{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "八道关口",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 116.99,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.376,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.126
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "审计不是安全的起点，也不是终点。",
   "spoken": "审计不是安全的起点，也不是终点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.196,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 4.294,
   "speechEnd": 6.936
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "它是流水线上的一个关口。",
   "spoken": "它是流水线上的一个关口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 7.992,
   "dur": 2.616,
   "speechStart": 8.09,
   "speechEnd": 9.768
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "它之前要有设计和测试，之后要有监控和应急。",
   "spoken": "它之前要有设计和测试，之后要有监控和应急。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 10.828,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 10.926,
   "speechEnd": 15.009
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "打个比方，合约开发像造一架飞机。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，合约开发像造一架飞机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 16.064,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 16.162,
   "speechEnd": 18.852
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "设计时画图纸，写下任何情况下机翼都不能断。",
   "spoken": "设计时画图纸，写下任何情况下机翼都不能断。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 19.908,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 20.006,
   "speechEnd": 24.137
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "每个零件出厂前都要测，还要放进风洞，用各种极端风向去吹。",
   "spoken": "每个零件出厂前都要测，还要放进风洞，用各种极端风向去吹。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 25.168,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 25.266,
   "speechEnd": 29.849
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "外部机构做适航认证，它不查每一颗螺丝，只抽查关键系统。",
   "spoken": "外部机构做适航认证，它不查每一颗螺丝，只抽查关键系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 30.908,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 31.006,
   "speechEnd": 35.589
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "飞上天以后，有黑匣子和地面雷达，出了事有应急程序。",
   "spoken": "飞上天以后，有黑匣子和地面雷达，出了事有应急程序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 36.648,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 36.746,
   "speechEnd": 41.377
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 42.436,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 42.534,
   "speechEnd": 44.319
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "飞机出厂后，还能召回维修。",
   "spoken": "飞机出厂后，还能召回维修。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 45.368,
   "dur": 3.168,
   "speechStart": 45.466,
   "speechEnd": 47.704
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "不可升级的合约，部署之后，就再也不能修改。",
   "spoken": "不可升级的合约，部署之后，就再也不能修改。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 48.756,
   "dur": 4.296,
   "speechStart": 48.854,
   "speechEnd": 52.211
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "所以前面的关口，必须更严。",
   "spoken": "所以前面的关口，必须更严。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 53.272,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 53.37,
   "speechEnd": 55.929
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "把这条流水线展开，一共八个关口。",
   "spoken": "把这条流水线展开，一共八个关口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 56.972,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 57.07,
   "speechEnd": 59.712
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "规格与威胁模型，安全编码规范，静态分析。",
   "spoken": "规格与威胁模型，安全编码规范，静态分析。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 60.768,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 60.866,
   "speechEnd": 64.711
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "单元、模糊和不变量测试，关键模块的形式化验证。",
   "spoken": "单元、模糊和不变量测试，关键模块的形式化验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 65.764,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 65.862,
   "speechEnd": 70.1
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "外部审计或竞赛，安全部署与权限移交。",
   "spoken": "外部审计或竞赛，安全部署与权限移交。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 71.144,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 71.242,
   "speechEnd": 74.611
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "最后是监控、漏洞赏金、应急响应和保险。",
   "spoken": "最后是监控、漏洞赏金、应急响应和保险。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 75.684,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 75.782,
   "speechEnd": 79.341
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "越靠左的关口，修复越便宜，规格阶段发现的问题，只要改文档。",
   "spoken": "越靠左的关口，修复越便宜，规格阶段发现的问题，只要改文档。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 80.392,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 80.49,
   "speechEnd": 85.668
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "静态分析、测试和形式化验证是自动的，每次提交代码都该跑一遍。",
   "spoken": "静态分析、测试和形式化验证是自动的，每次提交代码都该跑一遍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 86.708,
   "dur": 7.104,
   "speechStart": 86.806,
   "speechEnd": 92.996
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "静态分析误报多，不求零告警，要求每个告警都有结论。",
   "spoken": "静态分析误报多，不求零告警，要求每个告警都有结论。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 94.032,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 94.13,
   "speechEnd": 98.225
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "审计发现的问题，要反过来补成测试，防止以后再犯。",
   "spoken": "审计发现的问题，要反过来补成测试，防止以后再犯。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 99.292,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 99.39,
   "speechEnd": 103.556
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "但所有关口都有一个前提，你想到了要检查什么。",
   "spoken": "但所有关口都有一个前提，你想到了要检查什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 104.624,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 104.722,
   "speechEnd": 109.079
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "经济攻击和跨协议的组合风险，常常要专门的经济审计。",
   "spoken": "经济攻击和跨协议的组合风险，常常要专门的经济审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 110.148,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 110.246,
   "speechEnd": 114.936
  }
